window.products.push({"id":539055,"name":"Saipro Preserved Natural Caspia Bouquet, 25 stem Real Fresh Limonium Bellidifolium, Sea Lavender, Baby Breath Flowers, for Wedding Birthday, Home Déco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718LBmD-RZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"💐Preserved Technology:Saipro flowers come from the flowering areas along the Pacific Coast where we plant high-yield and high-quality flowers. We utilize the most advanced Japan preservation and drying technology to keep the flowers soft and colorful. Although it has been picked for a long time, it is still very fresh, looks like fresh flowers. They add warmth to any room and do not attract pests or require maintenance. It is an excellent choice for busy people. 💐The Best Gift Choice: In flower language, caspia symbolizes perfect love. Just like a preserved caspia bouquet, love does not easily wither. With our bouquet, love will be fresh and everlasting. 💐Environmental Protection: Unlike artificial flowers, Our Saipro dried flowers are 100% natural. They are harvested using a non-toxic process, and no harmful chemicals are used to protect your flowers. Our flowers are naturally dried, so each flower is unparalleled, and the colors may be a little different from those in the photos. 💐Warm Space: These dried flower arrangement can bring warmth to any space and is very suitable for homes, shops, gift boxes, offices, weddings, restaurants, banquet decorations, and photography props. It can be used with roses, baby's breath and other dry flowers and artificial flowers. It is widely used as matching flowers in most countries. Of course, It can also be used as a separate bouquet, which is very elegant. 💐Warming Reminder: It is natural for some flowers to fall off during long-distance transportation. Please gently separate the flower branches and remove the fallen flowers before use. The scattered flowers can be used to make wreaths without any waste. They can be used for crafts or to continue decorating your lives! The color of each bunch of flowers is unique. If you are not satisfied, please contact us and we will offer you the best possible solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718LBmD-RZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saipro","source_asin":"B09VBKW9PQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VBKW9PQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VBKW9PQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
