window.products.push({"id":539078,"name":"Deluxe Chill Rocks Whiskey Gift Set - Whisky Scotch Chilling Stones – 8 Stainless Steel Beverage Cooling Soapstone Ice Cubes + Tongs + Freezer Tray - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71acnII3lUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a unique and unforgettable gift for the guys in your life? Men can be notoriously difficult to buy gifts for. Give him something he’ll love to look at just as much as he loves to use. This distinguished whiskey stone gift box is guaranteed to garner grins and excitement… even for the guys who have everything. Surprise your husband, boyfriend, dad, brother, in-laws or boss this upcoming birthday or holiday season with Chill Rocks by Quiseen . KIT INCLUDES: 8 x Stainless Steel Cubes 1 x Pair Stainless Steel Tongs w/ Rubber End 1 x Plastic Freezer Tray w/ Lid 1 x Matte Magnetic Gift Box Available in Blue & Silver or Black & Gold WHISKEY STONES MADE FROM STAINLESS STEEL We call them “whiskey stones” but these cool ice-alternatives work just as well with tequila, vodka, gin, bourbon, scotch and beyond. Serve your favorite cocktails and beverages on the rocks… except these “rocks” don’t melt. The stones have a stainless steel exterior with a subzero liquid interior that retains cold temperatures, keeping drinks chilled without diluting them. They even work for martinis and wine. Chill the stones safely in the freezer a few hours beforehand for maximum refreshment. DELUXE GIFT BOX The box these exquisite ice cubes arrive in will make you feel like a collector. Watch the gift recipient’s face light up in delight as they unbox the prize. ELEVATE YOUR HOME BAR AESTHETIC Be prepared to get tons of comments from guests about how awesome these chill rocks look on your home bar or bar cart. Even if you only drink water, this is a stunning must-have set for any self-respecting gentleman. GIVES A COOL & SATISFYING EDGE TO ANY DRINK Feel the texture, weight and high quality of the smooth stainless steel cubes as you sip and enjoy. Experience the full undiluted flavor of your favorite top shelf liquors… at the chilled, refreshing temperature you crave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71acnII3lUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quiseen","source_asin":"B09M7QB1MS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M7QB1MS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M7QB1MS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
