window.products.push({"id":539098,"name":"Wallies Wall Stickers, 4 Sheets, Slate Gray, 4 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714w8z1E9RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy decorating your walls with our wide variety of peel and stick, vinyl-coated decals to suit whatever taste or theme you like. Wallies are a fast and easy way to decorate a child's room, home office, kitchen or just about anywhere you want to add a little interest to your walls! Wallies are a great alternative to decorating with paint or stencils. And because Wallies are removable and repositionable, they aren't permanent like paint is so you can change your room's decor in seconds. In just a few minutes, you can really update your surroundings. Every Wallies design is made of durable, self-adhesive backed vinyl that can be removed and repositioned easily. To use, simply peel the pieces off of their backing and apply to any clean, smooth surface. Vinyl decals for the pantry, home office and playroom. Change your room decor in seconds! Removable and repositionable. Easy to remove, safe for most surfaces. Leaves no sticky residue. We offer an extensive variety of Wall Play items, such as alphabets, solar systems and dinosaurs, which are educational and fun. Kids love to interact with these products, easily arranging them for hours of fun. Wallies has wonderful wall stickers for kids in a variety of designs for babies’ rooms, kids’ rooms and more grown-up designs for living rooms, dining rooms and kitchens. From growth charts and murals, to message chalkboards and chalkboard labels, from playful fantasy to needed utility, Wallies has something for everyone in easy-to-use, easy-to-reuse, decals. With Wallies & hellip. The possibilities are endless! Product Disclaimer: Only authentic Wallies Peel & Stick Wall Decals are manufactured and shipped from the United States.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714w8z1E9RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallies","source_asin":"B01GWRSNFI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GWRSNFI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GWRSNFI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":539099,"name":"Authentic Vitamix Classic Tamper for the 64 oz Classic Container Jar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31OtHs-4C1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Designed for use with your 64-ounce CLASSIC Vitamix blender container, the Vitamix Tamper fits through the top opening of the container lid to push solid particles back down into the blender blades, for a faster, smoother and more uniform blending. The Tamper allows you to process thick mixtures and fully incorporate all ingredients into the blend. Designed for use with the 64-ounce Classic Container. This tamper will NOT work with 32 oz, 48 oz or Low Profile containers as it is too long and will impact the blades, damaging the tamper. Compatibility: 64-ounce Classic Container Dimensions: 12.75 inches Weight: 3.5 oz Material: BPA-free plastic Care: Dishwasher Safe, top rack Manufacturer: Vitamix - Cleveland, Ohio USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31OtHs-4C1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vitamix","source_asin":"B01JGX06SW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JGX06SW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JGX06SW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
