window.products.push({"id":539173,"name":"Toothbrush Holder Wall Mounted, 4 Cups Toothbrush Holder Wall Mounted with Toothpaste Dispenser, Large Capacity Tray, Drawer Cosmetic and 8 Brush Slot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61396c1qOqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【Multi-function Toothbrush Holder Set 】Different from the old wall toothpaste dispenser and toothbrush holder, our beautiful and novel style will give your bathroom a new look.We designed our wall mount toothbrush holder with an automatic toothpaste dispenser that can accommodate 4 cups and 8 toothbrush slots for family use. ✨【Safe & Health】The bathroom toothbrush holder is made of waterproof ABS material. The inverted cup design of the toothbrush holders can be used for dust prevention and drainage. The magnet at the bottom of the cup can be firmly fixed on the toothbrush storage to ensure that the inside of the cup is dry and prevent the cup from getting moldy. ✨【Easy to Install】The toothpaste dispenser are equipped with a sturdy non-marking sticker, strong adhesive glue, and a toothbrush holder wall mounted that is easy to install without drilling, will not fall off and break the wall. Please note that this sticker is only applicable to surfaces such as smooth tile, marble, glass. ✨【Non-Contact Operation, More Hygienic】With our automatic toothpaste dispenser, you can squeeze out an accurate and sufficient amount of toothpaste each time without direct contact and hand squeezing, making it more hygienic and convenient. This toothpaste dispenser is easy to clean. ✨【Saving Space From Your Countertop】The tooth brushing holder is easy to disassemble and clean, and easy to assemble. The multifunctional design of the toothbrush holders for bathrooms is very practical, a must-have bathroom gadgets at home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61396c1qOqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IDEALHOUSE","source_asin":"B097G9P1J4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097G9P1J4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097G9P1J4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":539174,"name":"ELO Premium Black Pearl Stainless Steel Kitchen Induction Cookware Pots and Pans Set with Easy-Pour Lids, Heat Resistant Handles and Integrated Measur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gBg20cP4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: - (1) 6.5-inch Stainless Steel 18/10 Sauce Pan (Liquid Capacity of 1.3 Liters or 1.37 quarts) - (1) 6.5-inch Stainless Steel 18/10 Casserole Pot (Liquid Capacity of 1.8 Liters or 1.9 quarts) - (1) 6.5-inch Easy-Pour Flat Glass Lid with Silicon Rim - (1) 8-inch Stainless Steel 18/10 Casserole Pot (Liquid Capacity of 3.3 Liters or 3.48 quarts) - (1) 8-inch Easy-Pour Flat Glass Lid with Silicon Rim - (1) 9.5-inch Stainless Steel 18/10 Casserole Pot(Liquid Capacity of 5.3 Liters or 5.6 quarts) - (1) 9.5-inch Easy-Pour Flat Glass Lid with Silicon Rim - Ready to be used on electric, gas, induction and glass ceramic stoves - Heat resistance up to 170 Celsius and 338 Fahrenheit. - Integrated proportion system for even heat distribution - Integrated measuring scale inside each pot and pan - Integrated easy-pour function lids - Ergonomic heat resistant nylon handles - Dishwasher safe About the Brand: In 1934 Karl Grünewald created a company that sold pots and pans in small regional markets. Later in 1959, his son Karl Grünewald junior started expanding the company by supplying not only small regional markets but also with large companies. The company started developing other innovated goods such as electric cookers and became one of the best-selling products. Due to their infamous best sellers in electric cookers, the name ELO became their company name deriving from the word ELektrO. Soon ELO was registered as a trademark. With constant updates on new designs and innovative technology it’s no wonder ELO was awarded “Product of the Year” in 2011 and the following year ELO was awarded “The Most Innovative Brand of the Year.” The company has been around for over 80 years and is constantly coming up with innovative products. Money Back Guarantee: If you are not happy with our product, simply return the item to Amazon for a full refund, but we are confident that you will LOVE our product!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gBg20cP4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELO Cookware","source_asin":"B01N42HLKK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N42HLKK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N42HLKK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
