window.products.push({"id":539234,"name":"Cotonoble Kitchen Apron for Women with Pocket and 2 Towels, Waterproof Cooking Apron for Women, Cute Apron, Made in Turkey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D4Q9Do3YL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Imported Drawstring closure machine wash A HANDY TOWEL FASTENED TO YOU: You wipe and wash your hands so often while working in the kitchen. Now you have a handy and absorbent towel fastened to you. When you need to dry your hands to answer an urgent call, what you need is right there with you: 100% Turkish Cotton absorbent towel to wipe your hands! When the towel is dirty, use the replacement towel provided while the other one is in the wash. STAY CLEAN AND STYLISH: Cooking, baking, or grilling can be messy. Cotonoble kitchen apron provides you great coverage and protection, keeping your clothes clean and safe from any grease, stains, and splatters. With a vibrant floral design that adds charm and brightens your look, you’ll get to serve those delectable meals without worries. Made of completely 100% waterproof material that keeps your clothes dry as you wash the dishes or do house chores. EXPERIENCE ULTIMATE COMFORT: Move freely with ease as you cook up a storm. No matter what your height, weight, or body type is, the fully-adjustable neck strap ensures the smartest and perfect fit. Enjoy the finest Turkish cotton fabric - a completely breathable material that gives you a soft, elegant feel possible - even if you’re cooking for hours. That’s superior craftsmanship designed safe for daily use and built to last. CONVENIENCE AT ITS FINEST: Designed to cater to your household needs, use the spacious front pocket to carry your cooking utensils - from seasoning packets, recipe cards, spatulas, thermometers, etc. With the smart pocket design of this kitchen apron, all the practical essentials you need are within reach. Saves you time and makes meal preparation a breeze. Now, you’ll be able to immerse yourself in your cooking experience and be the master chef of your kitchen! HAPPINESS GUARANTEED: Our apron is crafted with functionality, love, and care to give you and your loved ones 100% satisfaction! No matter what you're cooking or how you cook your meal, this kitchen apron guarantees to live up to your expectations. A thoughtful gift with style and value, making it the perfect housewarming or holiday gift for every woman who revels in the kitchen. Wear this apron when hosting a backyard BBQ or garden party and you’re sure to leave a lasting impression.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D4Q9Do3YL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cotonoble","source_asin":"B08CSY5TNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CSY5TNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CSY5TNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
