window.products.push({"id":539391,"name":"Miosal Electric Coffee Grinder Spice Grinder with Stainless Steel Blades and Removable Grinding Bowl for Beans, Spices, Dry Herbs, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B9fXQdcFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Spin Grinding System】 Thanks to the unique grinding system, this grinder can grind 60g coffee beans in 10-20 seconds; you can make fresh grinding at anytime without making too much noise. High power motor guarantee continuous and even grinding for better maintaining the original rich aroma and oil of the coffee bean ☕【Smart Lid Operation】 Just turn the lid clockwise to \"I\" position and hold it, then it start customizing fine or coarse coffee power by different operation time. You can stop the grinding whenever you want by releasing the lid. The transparent cover allows you to observe the grinding process, easier to control grinding fineness ☕【Stainless Steel Grinding Bowl and Blade】 The grinding cup and blade are made of high quality food-grade stainless steel, which are healthy and durable; does not discolor, react with food or alter flavors. Premium materials suitable for your daily use ☕【Removable Grinding Chamber】 The grinding chamber can be easily installed and detached, makes the filling and pouring more convenient. You can also immerse the grinding bowl in water to wash thoroughly, without worrying about getting the motor body wet ☕【Multifunction grinder】 Suitable to be used in kitchen, office and dormitory for coffee bean, pepper, rosemary, chili (Note: grinding rosemary, pepper and chili into fine powder may need 30-180 seconds, it depends on the dryness of the food). Its elegant appearance also makes it a sweet gift for your family and friends","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B9fXQdcFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miosal","source_asin":"B08HV3FHGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HV3FHGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HV3FHGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
