window.products.push({"id":539481,"name":"ShalinIndia Beaded Napkin Rings - Set of 8 Rings -Cream Napkin Rings Set -Diameter-1.5 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Zr+Mz0CXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Even the tiniest of details can make a big impact on the look of your tablescape for a special get-together. Adding tiny flourishes to bring elegance to the look of your table can transform any ordinary dinner party into a truly memorable affair, and our Indian Beaded Napkin Rings are the perfect special something to make any dinner table look one of a kind. Nothing says elegance quite like the color with its cool glow and shine. Our Indian Beaded Napkin Rings capture the beauty of the metallic hue with beautiful resin beads that cover the entire exterior of each and every ring. The shimmering beads will look gorgeous against all types of table linens regardless of their color or pattern. Measuring 1.5 inches in diameter, the Indian Beaded Napkin Rings can be used with all types of napkins and coordinate well with a variety of folding styles. The quality of the napkin rings is truly second to none, as each one is meticulously crafted by hand by artisans in India. Before shipping, the napkin rings are carefully inspected to ensure that every detail is truly flawless. If you're looking for an exceptional gift to present to someone special for a birthday, the winter holidays, a housewarming party or any other occasion, our Indian Beaded Napkin Rings are an excellent choice. The napkin rings can be used meal after meal, year after year due to their superior quality, and they are sure to be appreciated by anyone who frequently entertains in their home. Sold in a set of Eight, our Indian Beaded Napkin Rings will stand out to your guests and keep your napkins neatly wrapped until it's time to eat. Beautify your table by ordering a set of these napkin rings today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Zr+Mz0CXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shalinindia","source_asin":"B01CYEF7XO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CYEF7XO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CYEF7XO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
