window.products.push({"id":539505,"name":"36 Pieces Pastry Piping Bags Set, 3 Sizes Reusable Silicone Pastry Bags, Cupcake Icing Tips, Piping Bags Couplers and Frosting Bags Ties for Baking Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GvWOtQavL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"36 Pieces multicolored silicone pastry bags reusable icing piping bags, cupcake icing tips, piping bags couplers and frosting bags ties for baking cake cookies candy supplies  Features:  Durable to use: This pastry bag is thicker than normal pastry icing bag and can withstand stronger extrusion. With high strength and flexibility, easy to operate, not easy to damage, safely and conveniently to use.  Wide applications: Ideal cake decorating supplies to create many kinds of flowers and patterns on cakes, cupcakes, pies, cookies, candy, fondants, muffin that requires a variety of creams, frostings or fillings, easily increase you appetite and enable you to have a taste of yummy desserts with your family or friends.  How to use Put the coupler in pastry bags cut the extra parts, Do not cut too much or your icing coupler may slip out the bottom. Place the tip on the coupler and use the coupler ring to secure the tip to the outside of the icing bags. Tighten the tip into the coupler. Use a spoon to pick up the filling and insert it into the icing bags. Fill the bag in just 2/3 to 3/4. Slowly apply pressure to the bag through the hand at the top of the frosting bags until the filler begins to flow out.  Specifications: Material: stainless steel, silicone, plastic Size: as picture shown Color: as pictures show Quantity: 36 pieces  Package Include 3 x 12 Inch white pastry bags 3 x 14 Inch pink pastry bags 3 x 16 Inch blue pastry bags 9 x Icing tips 9 x Piping bag couplers 9 x Icing bag ties  Note: Please allow slight errors on size due to manual measurement. Pointed part, please keep them away from kids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GvWOtQavL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Patelai","source_asin":"B089NRQQPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NRQQPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NRQQPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
