window.products.push({"id":539542,"name":"Replacement Handle Pair for Revere Ware Pots/Dutch Ovens (Single Screw)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ApnhICgBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your Revere Ware pot looking great with new replacement Bakelite handles from RevereWareParts!  These handles are made for Revere Ware pots made between 1968 and the late 2010’s. They fit both copper bottom, stainless, and aluminum disk models made during those years that have handles that look like our replacements, have a Revere Ware stamp on the bottom, and use a single screw to attach to the pot. See the product pictures for some examples of compatible pots and the attachment brackets they have.  SOME IMPORTANT DETAILS  - Each package comes with a handle pair - two handles and two screws, enough for one pot.  - Don’t over-tighten the screw as you can crack the Bakelite - The screw is a 10-32 screw approx. 11mm long and has a Phillips head. Original screws for these handles had slotted heads, which stripped easily.  - The original Revere Ware part for this handle was 36134  FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS  Are the handles oven safe?  No, the handles are not safe to use in an oven. Most modern ovens, even when set for a safe temperature, will reach higher temperatures in areas that can damage Bakelite handles.  Are the handles dishwasher safe? Repeated washing in a dishwasher will dull the finish of Bakelite handles.   Will these handles fit any other cookware brands? These handles will only work on the specific Revere Ware types above. These are NOT made for Rena-Ware pots, which are different.  What other Revere Ware replacement parts are available? We also sell a number of other replacement parts made for Revere Ware cookware. You can find our complete list of items available on Amazon.com by clicking on our name under the Buy Now button and selecting the Products tab.  TROUBLESHOOTING  If you are unsure if these handles are the correct ones for you, have problems with installation, or need any other help, please don’t hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ApnhICgBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RevereWareParts.com","source_asin":"B002UM6NMU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002UM6NMU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002UM6NMU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
