window.products.push({"id":539816,"name":"Toxin-free Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags (set of 4) by Live Peaceful - Resealable & Airtight to keep your Sandwich, Lunch, Snacks, Meat and Vege","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GngevPaYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a food storage container that is easy to store and simple to organize while also being non-toxic and family friendly? Then our Ecofriendly Silicone Food Storage bags are perfect for you. The best choice of food storage container for your family's health - Our silicone food bags are made from 100% BPA-Free & Chemical Free Food Grade Silicone; the healthiest choice of material for food containers, made from natural sand. You can be worry free! Easy to store and organise! - No more mismatched lids and hunting for the right container! Our silicone bags are easily stored; rolled, stacked, folded or hung from the convenient hanging hole. Simple and quick to clean - Dishwasher friendly and can be turned inside out to hand wash. Hang or turn upside down to dry. Make life easy and save time, go straight from the freezer to the microwave! - Each silicone reusable food bag is highly temperature resistant and can be used in the freezer, fridge, microwave, steamer and for sous-vide cooking or poaching. Made from highly temperature resistant silicone, to temperatures of -40°C/-40°F to 445°F/230°C. Protect your valuables and store your food while backpacking, hiking, camping or canoeing - Our bags can be easily rolled and sealed for travel, they are sturdy and the vacuum seal will ensure no leaks in your bag. Use to store your cell phone and valuables and protect them from rain or water. Keep your food fresh and separate from ice in the cooler! The simple and ethical Eco-friendly choice - Our bags are sturdy, re-usable and are the most environmentally friendly choice. Buy them once and reuse them forever :) 100% Satisfaction Guarantee - Our bags are backed by our manufacturer 30-day money back guarantee and our 5 year free replacement warranty. Click on add to cart to get this amazing product!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GngevPaYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Live Peaceful","source_asin":"B07W95D6BN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-539816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W95D6BN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W95D6BN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
